sts{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"cb9c4859fef036a5a836dd8995cfdd0d277c6466","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commits/cb9c4859fef036a5a836dd8995cfdd0d277c6466","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commit/cb9c4859fef036a5a836dd8995cfdd0d277c6466"}]},"status":"ahead","ahead_by":3,"behind_by":0,"total_commits":3,"commits":[{"sha":"97395409044c97a44997ec8d7150304849e13be7","node_id":"C_kwDOTx3Fc9oAKDk3Mzk1NDA5MDQ0Yzk3YTQ0OTk3ZWM4ZDcxNTAzMDQ4NDllMTNiZTc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nick DeRobertis","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-01T00:51:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-01T00:51:50Z"},"message":"feat(deps)!: link the engine whose plan store makes a create safe to retry (#563)\n\n## What\n\nLink onepipeline 0.97.2 and align the test-only onetaskgraph\ndependencies with its 0.12.14 release. Record the upgrade and adapt\nexisting tests to the store’s copy API. Read-API behavior stays\nunchanged apart from the engine version reported by `/healthz`.\n\n## Why\n\nHosts need the read API and dispatching engine to share an engine\nrelease so the browser can parse the records being written. This upgrade\nlets hosts adopt the store’s retry-safe creates and guarded writes while\nkeeping their reader aligned.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe breaking-change designation announces the linked-engine move because\nthis crate’s public API exposes engine types. The lockfile also moves\nuuid to 1.29.0, as required by the updated store.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0527edee7daa7ff1b3170bc072721e4b305352d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/git/trees/0527edee7daa7ff1b3170bc072721e4b305352d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/git/commits/97395409044c97a44997ec8d7150304849e13be7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq5o0mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7tsQAFr+0fGWbjBOp0MBUtKWSpOW\n3OioVmufpJBLJVsGtxxJzzSRtdfmZ9oOvY4lkMUSM7pdmlmq9mqLtHRaxBA88MYT\n9zExdv0rf7VVv9Hnm3hSv//fkOMeb945nXFPolCsFo5HtVVH8xIVgp1TZKIJfkew\ncSKiE+2Z4F+lKcOPB1RINMjaV8eUgoB3n/+lEObK9IHqPFCsUgfebyg6eTe5ZKPV\nJjtHv1oeVFeueTvMxOhTUrRLNfwO/gbxYwrQDtHTSW0NgiFXqTyX8LH1h0MOmPU6\nVLv+Qz9wcuTTO413wkcmybX12ZqFPv0OJw+6EkPNf3uBbQ2OzekJwphidxgiiJZo\nvN1MeJwPnRLbv71x+PNdesT0tpdBJ9UHcWtSMrakNM7QXltAj7Fx/irA/NZ9SPEY\nffizB+VTAq1+3TPjCfXBax26jRcXWPtJaWRzkNJ2XqxtKXLtv0F0lDZnzEjqqiX8\nRB+PaE4llgsaG9FDZmkbbswQv3Yt8nLF1p9QaNOQ5o2/kufqBo99RxcYR3mW6yv+\nYkLWNaOfHhJ7dLvArj27QyrLQgp9IfrAxi+YkonyYcoZSsHen3YxOmH3OYTkAr0q\npI233u6SbiWGE95DCHSTXdHFRVbR9/rhAJe/+yo8Rvwa0t8syJ5udPnwjZNKz2Lg\nrlow6lhAuNw3Y0c5FskH\n=YAJQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0527edee7daa7ff1b3170bc072721e4b305352d8\nparent 31cbe3761a27fc6790e6706967f7f320dca10eb7\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1793494310 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1793494310 -0600\n\nfeat(deps)!: link the engine whose plan store makes a create safe to retry (#563)\n\n## What\n\nLink onepipeline 0.97.2 and align the test-only onetaskgraph\ndependencies with its 0.12.14 release. Record the upgrade and adapt\nexisting tests to the store’s copy API. Read-API behavior stays\nunchanged apart from the engine version reported by `/healthz`.\n\n## Why\n\nHosts need the read API and dispatching engine to share an engine\nrelease so the browser can parse the records being written. This upgrade\nlets hosts adopt the store’s retry-safe creates and guarded writes while\nkeeping their reader aligned.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe breaking-change designation announces the linked-engine move because\nthis crate’s public API exposes engine types. The lockfile also moves\nuuid to 1.29.0, as required by the updated store.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-11-01T00:51:51Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commits/97395409044c97a44997ec8d7150304849e13be7","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commit/97395409044c97a44997ec8d7150304849e13be7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commits/97395409044c97a44997ec8d7150304849e13be7/comments","author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"31cbe3761a27fc6790e6706967f7f320dca10eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commits/31cbe3761a27fc6790e6706967f7f320dca10eb7","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commit/31cbe3761a27fc6790e6706967f7f320dca10eb7"}]},{"sha":"cda01fbd7b3e26a3611d7cae24442e634aee5b8b","node_id":"C_kwDOTx3Fc9oAKGNkYTAxZmJkN2IzZTI2YTM2MTFkN2NhZTI0NDQyZTYzNGFlZTViOGI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nick DeRobertis","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-01T03:05:38Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-01T03:05:38Z"},"message":"fix(test): assert the host item's blocking line and heading separately (#566)\n\n## What\n\nFix the host-item browser journey to assert the detail’s metadata line\nand blocked-steps heading separately. Both intentionally say “blocks all\nwork on this host”; the journey now identifies each unambiguously and\nretains the list-card assertion. The view is unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\nThe ambiguous locator fails Playwright’s strict mode in the required\nLinux test job, blocking every read-API release—including the engine\nupdate that makes plan creation safe to retry.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fe19189de1e225d97b43503a2fa6b483d3ab435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/git/trees/9fe19189de1e225d97b43503a2fa6b483d3ab435"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/git/commits/cda01fbd7b3e26a3611d7cae24442e634aee5b8b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq5qyCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQwcQACbLgPQzZ0/P2PFFZIE8V2jG\nZEpUBi8suePl3iIzVj8w1KCl99vgq3nbyaYbX/19Hdsb706uwZsT8FuCYoCUxzeY\nvf+i+tyGGOc5zN6/PeBqyyYdw4QzYx8ycngk3kt5WiUgasBvGqcJf8JMHk+Stxby\n+gmZeCCSYg0fSlRT5q4lwsvLnhQbAbIdWsOQdNpyUtX40hBRKb7eVdkcdiSD/VRz\ng3KFXgjVlW1IaPJZf4xT6KpMSvO32ZKpyfw2pFtecY2iI0kinvPSWyP0GCSOxUlQ\n6L4y5WDtMkQlDrMc1OH20rr3t+5IiRQcTUFtfDkPr3dPASjgbTxnRiT7HRZbEmkg\njg2A2msKR+7a128gHqIlbgXvuVMmUhShe6ko1gOEQnHfJQVqbEuLJUsBkc7ni/Y8\nuflf+29HZmAx2RLFc1Cx+RVm52Kgf3Hfs8kItcoKve7XkYoHXAnyoNF4Fgo+Vxkq\njkkS0k9gtjD4CyVU0wzjQoWiNhG7G6cAIWqXCHAflL0J9b4Vd31ABIbzGpeveT4V\nHEJUEVuyHGjLJCddDhtuaH1CLqUkhVZqQIpnpZ0Fwqgyf6e4QEEJRYkozJNocey/\nYaGUXbPI2HZqu/oEkkNsx6pLHt/3G6KIn2fcGtHTNVpsK9qjCNfH6vD3SWqFSUVb\nlkXXDL+ukoEUgQUqZtUN\n=JfrR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9fe19189de1e225d97b43503a2fa6b483d3ab435\nparent 97395409044c97a44997ec8d7150304849e13be7\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1793502338 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1793502338 -0600\n\nfix(test): assert the host item's blocking line and heading separately (#566)\n\n## What\n\nFix the host-item browser journey to assert the detail’s metadata line\nand blocked-steps heading separately. Both intentionally say “blocks all\nwork on this host”; the journey now identifies each unambiguously and\nretains the list-card assertion. The view is unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\nThe ambiguous locator fails Playwright’s strict mode in the required\nLinux test job, blocking every read-API release—including the engine\nupdate that makes plan creation safe to retry.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-11-01T03:05:38Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commits/cda01fbd7b3e26a3611d7cae24442e634aee5b8b","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commit/cda01fbd7b3e26a3611d7cae24442e634aee5b8b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/commits/cda01fbd7b3e26a3611d7cae24442e634aee5b8b/comments","author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://gi